  "body": "> **Synchronous XMLHttpRequest** on the main thread is deprecated because of its detrimental effects to the end user's experience. \r\n> For more help, check https://xhr.spec.whatwg.org/.\r\n\r\n```\r\nvar xhr = new XMLHttpRequest();\r\nxhr.open(\"GET\", \"https://www.codecademy.com/\", false);\r\nxhr.send();\r\n\r\nconsole.log(xhr.status);\r\nconsole.log(xhr.statusText);\r\n```\r\n![synchronous xmlhttprequest](https://cloud.githubusercontent.com/assets/18028768/23076347/058e62b0-f57b-11e6-9ce5-e536084118d3.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/whatwg/fetch\r\n",
